WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.502
You don't invite
a divorced couple to a wedding,

00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:04.254
it's a very
combustible situation.

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:06.089
You should--
Two sides, pick one!

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.590
♪ (MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:08.883
I need your weights, by the way.

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:10.510
-SUSIE GREENE:
What do you mean?
-For the plane.

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:13.179
I'd rather be dead in
the Sea of Cortez

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:15.432
than have you know what I weigh.

00:00:15.932 --> 00:00:17.892
-Oh! ¿Qué pasa, Larry?
-What?

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:20.562
-Are you kidding me?
-Yeah, not bad, huh?

00:00:20.937 --> 00:00:22.647
-How's your room?
-It stinks!

00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:24.023
SUSIE:
 Why did you even come here?

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:27.110
'Cause everybody was going.
It was presented to me
like it would be fun.

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:29.487
-SUSIE: We're having fun.
-JEFF GREENE: It is fun.

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:30.989
Yeah... I'm having fun.

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:34.159
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

